  "title": "Leftover Turkey and Mashed Potato Pie",
  "description": "Leftover turkey, mashed potatoes, and gravy are combined in a savory biscuit-topped pie, making excellent use of Thanksgiving extras!",
  "authors": [
    "Melissa Kay"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-11-27T20:16:03-05:00",
